From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:00:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] ci: add path-filtered per-package CI and ported upstream
 checks

- test-python.yml / test-node.yml: reusable test workflows. Python: shared matrix 3.12, 3.13, locked dependencies, explicit Python version in every command; frontends: lint, format, typecheck, unit, Cypress component and e2e, coverage, as upstream (codespell runs in pre-commit).
- api, federation-api, bagel-cli, annotation-tool, query-tool workflows: run when the package, deploy/, testdata/ or the shared workflow changes. api deselects its service-dependent integration tests.
- query-tool examples: diff against testdata/ on PRs (comment workflow), update PR on main.
- link-check.yml: api linkspector and annotation-tool lychee with their own configs.
- stale, scorecard and handle_external_pr ported from the org templates.
